Package: oochgrp
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Depends: libc6
Description: Sovereign GROUP CHANGER
 Updates primary and auxiliary group associations for filesystem paths.
 Pure openOODA utility with zero ambient authority, systemd-tmpfiles declarative
 synthesis, terminal ergonomics, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) server.
